1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,389 --> 00:00:39,364
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 19=

3
00:00:39,462 --> 00:00:40,692
(I love you, marry me.)

4
00:00:40,719 --> 00:00:42,079
Will you marry me?

5
00:01:19,819 --> 00:01:21,239
You fool.

6
00:01:22,727 --> 00:01:25,127
(I love you, marry me.)

7
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:25,959
Yes, yes.

8
00:01:26,519 --> 00:01:27,400
I'm a fool.

9
00:01:29,219 --> 00:01:30,140
But your fool.

10
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:31,640
You really are.

11
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,959
Such a fool.

12
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,159
Pei Yiqiu.

13
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,560
If you asked me here

14
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,159
to break up with me,

15
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,240
it's not happening.

16
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,740
If

17
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:16,520
you want me to join that program,

18
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:19,840
I'll go.

19
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:21,800
Just say the word.

20
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:24,000
But do you want to go?

21
00:02:40,060 --> 00:02:40,860
Qiu,

22
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:44,479
when you talk about your patients,

23
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:47,159
your eyes light up.

24
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:50,539
Stop lying to yourself.

25
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:01,580
Maybe at first,

26
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:07,159
I really did apply to medical school

27
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:09,919
because you said you liked doctors.

28
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,659
But later, I realized

29
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,860
that I seemed to have truly fallen for

30
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:18,180
the profession of being a doctor.

31
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:21,039
I love healing people.

32
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:23,800
I love being in the operating room.

33
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:26,979
I love seeing patients open their eyes.

34
00:03:57,819 --> 00:03:58,580
Go.

35
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:00,780
These two years

36
00:04:01,379 --> 00:04:03,139
will give us both some time.

37
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:04,879
I think

38
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:09,259
we can grow into better people together.

39
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:06,319
Here. Travel safe.

40
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:13,819
You're leaving so soon.

41
00:05:13,819 --> 00:05:15,259
Now my wedding has to wait.

42
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:18,480
The program dates are fixed.

43
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:20,160
I'll be back as soon as I can.

44
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,480
You and my brother-in-law

45
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,480
can go ahead.

46
00:05:26,259 --> 00:05:27,100
There's no rush.

47
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,420
We got our certificate.

48
00:05:28,699 --> 00:05:29,360
We'll wait for you.

49
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,519
My brother-in-law doesn't mind?

50
00:05:33,319 --> 00:05:35,079
He'd better not!

51
00:05:36,079 --> 00:05:36,879
Of course.

52
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:38,480
You're the boss, honey.

53
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,100
Here.

54
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:41,500
Oh, no. It's fattening!

55
00:05:41,699 --> 00:05:42,420
I'm on a diet.

56
00:05:43,779 --> 00:05:44,220
Qiu,

57
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:46,420
if you need anything over there,

58
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,480
just call me.

59
00:05:47,779 --> 00:05:50,199
I have colleagues at our branch there.

60
00:05:52,759 --> 00:05:54,060
Just look after my sister.

61
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:56,019
Of course I will.

62
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,600
Sis,

63
00:06:01,220 --> 00:06:02,620
take care of Wanqing for me.

64
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,660
If she's lost weight when I get back,

65
00:06:04,860 --> 00:06:05,839
you're first on my list.

66
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:07,620
Don't worry.

67
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:09,879
She's my best friend. Of course I will.

68
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:13,180
As for you, no flirting abroad.

69
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:15,300
Or you're not welcome home.

70
00:06:20,699 --> 00:06:21,540
Wait for me.

71
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:23,220
I will.

72
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:37,079
Got your passport and everything?

73
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:38,439
Wait!

74
00:06:38,779 --> 00:06:39,480
Am I late?

75
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,720
Slow down. What's the rush?

76
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:43,019
You know the flight time,

77
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:44,019
don't you?

78
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,439
Everyone's waiting for you.

79
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:46,279
Honestly!

80
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:49,519
Wanqing won her first case yesterday.

81
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:51,519
We celebrated and drank too much.

82
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:52,240
I overslept.

83
00:06:52,319 --> 00:06:52,920
My fault.

84
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,139
Oh,

85
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,879
your other sis, Wanqing,
heard you're going abroad.

86
00:06:56,939 --> 00:06:58,459
She asked me to remind you

87
00:06:58,759 --> 00:06:59,920
to study hard,

88
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,899
and not just have fun.

89
00:07:00,899 --> 00:07:01,939
Come back when you've
finished your studies.

90
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,560
All right. Let's go.

91
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,560
Come on. Get in.

92
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,500
(When I come back,)

93
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,899
(I won't call you sis anymore, Wanqing.)

94
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,360
(I'll make something of myself.)

95
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,540
(I'll earn my place)

96
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:22,500
(by your side.)

97
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:37,240
(Trust me.)

98
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:39,420
(The next time we meet,)

99
00:07:39,660 --> 00:07:41,379
(we'll never be apart again.)

100
00:07:43,533 --> 00:07:49,100
(Cheng A J5630)

101
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,560
(I'm leaving tomorrow.)

102
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,680
(Before I go,)

103
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:05,699
(I want to make you a promise.)

104
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:19,339
(I'll protect you
for the rest of my life.)

105
00:08:20,259 --> 00:08:21,579
(Will you marry me?)

106
00:08:48,441 --> 00:08:50,107
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
